<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Manuscript Review Invitation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #d4a017;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
        }
        .header h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .content p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: block;
            width: fit-content;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #d4a017;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            background-color: #b28314;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #d4a017;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Invitation to Review Manuscript</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{reviewerName}},</p>
            <p>You have been invited to review a manuscript submitted to <strong>SLUJST</strong>.</p>
            <p><strong>Manuscript Title:</strong> {{manuscriptTitle}}</p>

            {{#if reviewDueDate}}
                <p><strong>Review Due Date:</strong> {{reviewDueDate}}</p>
            {{/if}}

            <p>Please log in to your reviewer account to access the manuscript and submit your review.</p>
            <a href="https://slujst.slu.edu.ng/reviewer" class="cta-button">Access Manuscript</a>

            <p>If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:TEA@slujst.slu.edu.ng">TEA@slujst.slu.edu.ng</a>.</p>
            <p>Best Regards,<br><strong>Editorial Team</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{year}} Sule Lamido University Journal of Science and Technology. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
